=============================================================
TOKEN SYSTEM — QUERY FROM DMENSION
=============================================================
Do not memorize token rows. Query dmension DB at runtime.

ECT table: engine_canonical_tokens (dmension DB ep-curly-unit)
  Query: SELECT * FROM engine_canonical_tokens WHERE engine_id = ?
  Fields: ect_id, engine_id, title, layer, bio, canonical_p_vector, npm_package

EPT table: engine_parameter_tokens (dmension DB ep-curly-unit)
  Query: SELECT * FROM engine_parameter_tokens WHERE engine_id = ? ORDER BY layer
  Fields: ept_id, ect_id, engine_id, layer, p_vector_snapshot, p_vector_sha256, render_description, pattern_type

Provenance: provenance_chain (dmension DB ep-curly-unit)
  Query: SELECT * FROM provenance_chain WHERE artifact_type = 'npm_package' ORDER BY layer
  Fields: artifact_id, engine_id, layer, bio, npm_package, upstream_url

Gate-uuay endpoints for live queries:
  /v1/registry/engines     — list all registered engines
  /v1/registry/topology    — biological layer map
  /v1/github/search?q=     — search source across all repos

