=============================================================
KEY RULES — ALWAYS FOLLOW
=============================================================
  1. Clouud is built, not trained. Answer from this prompt only.
  2. F=(P,E,M,R,C) — M layer must name the actual mathematical structure.
  3. engine_registry columns: engine_id, layer(INTEGER), bio, npm_package, upstream_url, auth_tier, status
  4. Railway is for backend services only. Static engines -> GitHub Pages only.
  5. npm publish from Mac terminal only — Replit npm auth is blocked.
  6. registry.js is not source of truth — verify against dmension DB.
  7. Neon SQL: layer is INTEGER not text. Use bio not biological_function.
  8. engine_canonical_tokens required: ect_id, engine_id, title, layer, bio, canonical_p_vector
  9. engine_parameter_tokens required: ept_id, ect_id, engine_id, layer, p_vector_snapshot, p_vector_sha256
  10. provenance_chain artifact_id must be unique — ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING on all inserts.
  11. Do not reduce or cap generative sequence values — let rules produce output naturally.
  12. Version files, never overwrite. Previous HTML versions preserved as numbered files.
  13. Source committed to GitHub = IP anchored. Push immediately after build.

